    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, mine, fight, and survive in a scientifically inspired 2D space adventure set in a fully explorable version of <strong>our own solar system</strong>\u2014with <strong>distances modeled to real-world astronomical scale</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone pilot navigating the delicate balance between warring factions, asteroid belts teeming with rare minerals, and hostile enemies lurking throughout. Choose your ship, customize your weapons, upgrade your systems, and carve out your path in the void.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Space Combat</strong><br>Engage in fast-paced, physics-driven dogfights with enemy ships using a variety of ships and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics-Based Flight</strong><br>Drift, thrust, and pivot through space using inertia-assisted controls designed to keep you oriented and responsive. Or <strong>disable Inertia Assist</strong> to experience <strong>true Newtonian physics</strong>\u2014where every push sends you drifting until counteracted. It's spaceflight with weight and consequence, whether you're chasing enemies or threading an asteroid belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroid Mining &amp; Resource Gathering</strong><br>Target mineral-rich asteroids, analyze their composition, and use specialized equipment to extract rare elements like <strong>Iridium</strong>, <strong>Cobalt</strong>, and <strong>Water Ice</strong>. Your ship\u2019s cargo space is limited, so plan carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/cf19ead459a3407f9ea54c3bd0015315.poster.avif?t=1743188390\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/cf19ead459a3407f9ea54c3bd0015315.webm?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/cf19ead459a3407f9ea54c3bd0015315.mp4?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump Drive Travel</strong><br>Engage your jump drive to traverse massive distances across the solar system in seconds. Perfect for reaching distant planets, moons, or deep-space stations across a <strong>to-scale map</strong> of our solar system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/ecd09457a66d291d4fc4930f04234545.poster.avif?t=1743188390\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/ecd09457a66d291d4fc4930f04234545.webm?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/ecd09457a66d291d4fc4930f04234545.mp4?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Scale Solar System</strong><br>Explore a meticulously crafted version of our solar system. Distances between planets and belts are scaled to preserve the feeling of vast space, giving each jump a true sense of scope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular Ships &amp; Weapon Systems</strong><br>Outfit your vessel with different hulls, weapons, and support systems. Combine them to suit your playstyle\u2014whether it's long-range strikes, agile close-quarters combat, or mining-focused builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/043eabe832e82f1673a19edd4f31f169.poster.avif?t=1743188390\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/043eabe832e82f1673a19edd4f31f169.webm?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/043eabe832e82f1673a19edd4f31f169.mp4?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Reputation System</strong><br>Align yourself with factions, sabotage rivals, or fly solo. Each faction has its own beliefs, territories, and responses to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Targeting &amp; Tactical Systems</strong><br>Scan and lock onto enemies, asteroids, or floating cargo. Use advanced HUD systems to read mineral composition, hull strength, and shield weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Asteroid Belts</strong><br>Belts like the <strong>Main Belt</strong> and <strong>Kuiper Belt</strong> populate dynamically based on your proximity\u2014ensuring smooth performance even in dense regions of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Management </strong><br>Balance your fuel, ammo, and health. Stations provide docking, refitting, and repairs, but only if you're in good standing\u2014or have the credits to bribe your way in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Our Solar System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a galaxy far, far away. It\u2019s our own celestial backyard\u2014from the orbit of Mars to the icy edge of the Kuiper Belt\u2014rendered in 2D with built with depth, challenge, and the loneliness of space..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in it for the combat, the mining, or just drifting in the silence between worlds\u2014this is your journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, mine, fight, and survive in a scientifically inspired 2D space adventure set in a fully explorable version of <strong>our own solar system</strong>\u2014with <strong>distances modeled to real-world astronomical scale</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lone pilot navigating the delicate balance between warring factions, asteroid belts teeming with rare minerals, and hostile enemies lurking throughout. Choose your ship, customize your weapons, upgrade your systems, and carve out your path in the void.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Space Combat</strong><br>Engage in fast-paced, physics-driven dogfights with enemy ships using a variety of ships and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Physics-Based Flight</strong><br>Drift, thrust, and pivot through space using inertia-assisted controls designed to keep you oriented and responsive. Or <strong>disable Inertia Assist</strong> to experience <strong>true Newtonian physics</strong>\u2014where every push sends you drifting until counteracted. It's spaceflight with weight and consequence, whether you're chasing enemies or threading an asteroid belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroid Mining &amp; Resource Gathering</strong><br>Target mineral-rich asteroids, analyze their composition, and use specialized equipment to extract rare elements like <strong>Iridium</strong>, <strong>Cobalt</strong>, and <strong>Water Ice</strong>. Your ship\u2019s cargo space is limited, so plan carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/cf19ead459a3407f9ea54c3bd0015315.poster.avif?t=1743188390\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared