ed loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/043eabe832e82f1673a19edd4f31f169.poster.avif?t=1743188390\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/043eabe832e82f1673a19edd4f31f169.webm?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621370/extras/043eabe832e82f1673a19edd4f31f169.mp4?t=1743188390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Reputation System</strong><br>Align yourself with factions, sabotage rivals, or fly solo. Each faction has its own beliefs, territories, and responses to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Targeting &amp; Tactical Systems</strong><br>Scan and lock onto enemies, asteroids, or floating cargo. Use advanced HUD systems to read mineral composition, hull strength, and shield weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Asteroid Belts</strong><br>Belts like the <strong>Main Belt</strong> and <strong>Kuiper Belt</strong> populate dynamically based on your proximity\u2014ensuring smooth performance even in dense regions of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Management </strong><br>Balance your fuel, ammo, and health. Stations provide docking, refitting, and repairs, but only if you're in good standing\u2014or have the credits to bribe your way in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Our Solar System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a galaxy far, far away. It\u2019s our own celestial backyard\u2014from the orbit of Mars to the icy edge of the Kuiper Belt\u2014rendered in 2D with built with depth, challenge, and the loneliness of space..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in it for the combat, the mining, or just drifting in the silence between worlds\u2014this is your journey.</p>",
